  message: "Centrality face (member INV-napap) resolved in commit 037a3730de: centrality_scores renamed to additional_file_centrality_scores (accurate name) and the whole sketch_precomputed block marked x-internal in docs/schema.json (declaring it NOT a public stability contract, per spec.md). That addresses face (c) 'accurate name' plus the schema-status gap for the centrality member. The META stays OPEN: the readme_description face (INV-modor, blockquote-prefix concat) and vocabulary face (INV-padoz, no lemmatization) remain, and there is still no typed SketchPrecomputed dataclass owning per-field invariants (the full Wave-4 sketch-cache:F1 contract)."  # 29a5
